      {"t":"type","p":"We're from the US. (not including the listener)","a":["Taga-Amerika mi","Taga-Amerika kami"],"hint":"taga- · Amerika · mi","x":["kita"],"why":"The short pronoun mi goes in second place: Taga-Amerika mi."},
      {"t":"type","p":"Where are you all from?","a":["Taga-asa mo","Taga-asa kamo"],"hint":"taga- · asa · mo","x":["ka"],"why":"The short pronoun mo (you all) goes in second place, after taga-asa."}
