      {"t":"type","p":"Ana's kitchen","a":["ang kusina ni Ana","kusina ni Ana"],"hint":"kusina · Ana","x":["sa"],"why":"Names take ni when they own something: ang kusina ni Ana."},
      {"t":"type","p":"our house (yours and mine)","a":["atong balay","balay nato"],"hint":"atong · balay","x":["among"],"why":"atong includes the listener, and akong-set words go before the noun: atong balay."}
