      {"t":"type","p":"My house is new.","a":["Bag-o ang akong balay","Bag-o ang balay nako","Bag-o akong balay"],"hint":"bag-o · akong · balay","x":["ako"],"why":"The main word comes first, and akong goes before the noun: Bag-o ang akong balay."},
      {"t":"type","p":"Ana's house is big.","a":["Dako ang balay ni Ana"],"hint":"dako · balay · Ana","x":["sa"],"why":"The main word comes first, and names take ni as owners: Dako ang balay ni Ana."}
